#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/applylut.rst:195
msgid "Click on :kbd:`Install` to download and install the selected LUT file."
msgstr ""
"Kliknutím na :kbd:`Inštalovať` stiahnete a nainštalujete vybraný súbor LUT."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/applylut.rst:202
msgid ""
"A good explanation of and examples for how to use LUTs for color grading are "
